Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:03.48,Note,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,牧师Boyle带领你走向光辉时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverend Buddy Boyle Going For Glowing Hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,当天使降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}When angels come and knock in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,奉献出的你躯壳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人类的许可 天使是无法附身的对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels can't possess a human without permission,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以天使们用这家伙寸照容器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what?They're using this guy to find vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有一大堆心甘情愿的观众啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a willing audiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁让Crowley掌握大权的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who put Crowley in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是我们的王\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是个商人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a salesman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们来谈谈更朝换代\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I have to talk about the regime change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我们的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your demon ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就要变成个混蛋人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is going to be a mortal ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一眨眼的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be damn quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do I start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,才能求得宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}To even look for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不如从这个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we start with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你变成凡人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeke\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel不能留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel cannot stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.61,0:00:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他会把天使们都引到这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll bring the angels down to all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他能避开天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's warded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.97,0:00:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但他还是被April找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was warded when April found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.87,0:00:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我就有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.34,0:00:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你怎么会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,you're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he stays.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.94,0:00:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕我就只能离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'll have no choice but to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:00:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass 咱们需要谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass can we talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:00:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:08.30,Note,,0,0,0,,(雷克斯福德 爱达荷州)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 先生 你在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir,sir can you hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.07,0:01:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦您说点儿什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,please just say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,随便说点儿什么 我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep talking and I can help you through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 先生 如果你还在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,sir,if you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,请别挂断电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在可能很绝望 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may feel hopeless right now but.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.89,0:01:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你打这个热线是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you call the hotline for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,在你内心深处 还是有求生欲望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some part of you that still want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还是知道自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some parts that know suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是热线电话里那位女士叫你来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the lady from the hotline send you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是你叫我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.59,0:03:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,来击个掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}High five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,早啊 Steve\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning,Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,快递\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,击 个掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}High five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把孩子送到育儿所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to drop the baby off at the daycare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一路上净是红灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then hit every red lights on the way here but.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我不需要担心什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I should've worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.10,0:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,店面看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,咖啡杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee urns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.73,0:03:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,满的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,牛奶呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dairy case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.45,0:03:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,都装好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve,last questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,从前你都去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟其他的销售助理不大一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not like the other sales associates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你有些 不一样的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something different about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.47,0:03:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我能保证我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you there's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.38,0:03:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:03:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你的大好消息就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your big news is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把预言石翻译成了涂鸦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You translated the tablets into doodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.37,0:04:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是楔形文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Cuneiform.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.11,0:04:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法直接把预言石翻译成英语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hit a wall translating the tablet into English.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我发现了一本古老的手抄本\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I find an ancient codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,能把天使文翻译成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linking the angel script to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,古埃兰楔形文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proto-Elamite Cuneiform and.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我就能把预言石板和笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was able to translate the tablets and the footnotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.01,0:04:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,都翻译成古埃兰文 但是它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into Elamite which is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是涂鸦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,早就灭绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你能认出这些字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one cans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,学者们已经研究好几个世纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scholars have tried for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 这是个死胡同\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,it's an dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不完全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大多数古埃兰文字都是抽象的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,most Proto-Elamite is abstract.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.11,0:04:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但我从Metatron的笔记里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was able to decipher one phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,认出了一个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Metatron's footnotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,坠落的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falling angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.01,0:04:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那些笔记涉及到了Metatron的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}The footnotes refer to Metatron's spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:04:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.98,0:05:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我们能翻译出笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,maybe if we can decipher the footnotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,也许就能逆转咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we can reverse the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,让那帮长翅膀的混蛋滚回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punt those wingy dicks back to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,从哪儿入手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,查资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Research.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.28,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,泡泡图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comb through the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,看看能不能找到埃兰文的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can find anything else on Elamite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.53,0:05:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Zimmerman灭绝语言大百科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zimmerman's Encyclopedia of Extinct Languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,第一卷 Adai到Adakapa\N{\fnArial\fs30}Volume 1:Adai to Adakapa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿一共多少卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many volumes are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.42,0:05:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,24卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}24.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 一卷都没丢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry,we've got them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,太及时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我这儿有个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have a case for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,爱达荷州 雷克斯福德市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four were missing in Rexford Idaho.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有四例失踪人口 疑似死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presumed dead,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体很奇特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Body's been released a lovelies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.59,0:05:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而且案发现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there were reports of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还发现了一种奇怪的物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}A strange substance at the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.97,0:05:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很高兴联系上你 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,hello to you,too Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.99,0:05:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.85,0:06:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我 很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那你想怎么入手调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,so how do you want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你在现场见 还是我去接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to meet you at the latest scene or want me to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got my hands full over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass 你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得你想了解一下案情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you'd want to know about the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你确定一切都正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,you sure everything is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他没说自己在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he said nothing about where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也没提他都干了什么是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what he's been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.29,0:06:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他可从来都不擅长聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you forgot he's not exactly chatty Cathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不准备在爱达荷州去见见他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not even gonna see him when you're in Idaho.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了 只要天使看见他就像猫看见猫薄荷一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said,as long as he's on his catnip for angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他就要刻意跟咱们保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's keeping a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切有什么意义吗 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what's the point,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这都不算我们管的案子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,it's barely even case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我这就上路 去看看他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm gonna go and have a little look see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会把所有精力都浪费在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not gonna waste the whole of the menpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,一堆没用的破烂上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a big pile of nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是找借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other words,a perfect excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不想查资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}To bail out on research.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,被你发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 Steve\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.17,0:06:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我在储物柜里发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this in the supply closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:06:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这是谁的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know whose it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我还在储物格子了发现了一卷睡袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also found a roll of sleeping bag on the tool locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我想仔细把存货清单都查一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes I wanted to be thourough with inventory so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以上周末加班有点儿晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked late last weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿睡上一觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking a nap here was easier than.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,比回家在床上睡方便多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going back home to my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.51,0:07:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我有床 也有家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which I have,of course,a bed in home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Steve 你真是太负责任了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve,you're so responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直没好意思问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been afraid to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想仗着你是我员工就占你便宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to take advantage of you as my employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不想破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I certainly don't want to jeopardize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们的同事关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our working relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.16,0:07:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但是作为一个单亲妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as a working single mom,it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,约会是一件可遇不可求的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard enough to get a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我碰上了一个这么好的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let alone meet a really great guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.09,0:07:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,明天晚上我休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow is my night off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你也休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you're off too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我在想有没有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was just wondering if there's any chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:08:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,明晚你有时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you're free tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,非常有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 有四个人失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,four missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,四个都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡已经证实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,四个受害者有什么共同的敌人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And any common threat you can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Joe的速拨通讯录上有自杀开导热线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe in there had a suicide hot line on speed dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,上一个失踪的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the gal before him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,生病在家 抽屉里收集的抗忧郁药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a shut-in who had enough anti-depressants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,多得能开药店了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In her medicion cabinet to stock a pharmacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一号受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}First victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是苏格市的一对夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maried a couple out of sugar city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.69,0:08:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,以和谐离婚而出名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much a walking billboard for no fault divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们生活上都不是很顺心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were they all basket cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你让我列出\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me to make a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,本地最悲观的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of this county saddest sacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们四个绝对是打头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These four will be right on the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 四个不开心的受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,so four unhappy people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一个有自杀倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them definitely suicidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你已经排除自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've ruled out suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你会需要它们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are goona want to put these on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这看起来像是自杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This look like suicide to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.49,0:09:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,血迹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如果实验结果跟其他前几个一样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the tests come back same as the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这是所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,血液 皮肤 毛发 指甲 内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood,skin,hair,nails internal organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至还有衣料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even clothing fibres.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就像他们自己钻进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like these poor souls,got run to the.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上最好的碎木机一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}World's finest wood-chipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,跟其他案件一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,邻居们说有什么 一阵粉红色的光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neighbors reported some kind of a pink flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到这儿的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是所有剩下的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that was left was this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.47,0:09:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们基本都查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,we're almost through texts over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:09:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你应该试试打给Morrison教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe try professor Morrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们联系不上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,he's unreachable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他休假了 去新几内亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took a sabbatical to live amongst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,愉快地玩耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trobrianders of Papus New Guinea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在陷入了僵局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needless to say,we are pretty burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,there's one guy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都没事干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's nothing notify-rested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说Crowley吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把他绑着又不是为了好玩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not keeping him chained up for the one liners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,值得一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's worth a shot I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.81,0:10:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,小心行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be careful all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别被他的小伎俩耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fall for his quid pro quo crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass给的线索有什么进展吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Cass's lead panning out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,四个受害人 突然爆炸至死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four victims suddenly exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我测过电磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I've tried the EMF.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也找过巫术袋或者硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've looked for the hex bag,sulfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.89,0:10:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,人体自燃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spontaneous combustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,图勒人干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the Thules.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经把它们排除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already ruled them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体是蒸发了 不是烧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bodies were vaporised,weren't burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来是我们管的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like a real case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 我应该跟你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,I should be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不了 没有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,man,that's not nessacary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.50,0:10:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this one covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他甩了我 Jace\N{\fnArial\fs30}He dumped me,Jace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在食堂里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,当着所有人的面\N{\fnArial\fs30}In front of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:11:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,实在是 谁会这么做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like,who does that,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不能在Facebook上把我甩了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't he just dump me on facebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,像个正常人那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a normal person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.47,0:11:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是社交上还是情感上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Socially and romantically.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,完全的失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totaled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.43,0:11:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我想钻地洞了 Jace\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so embarrassed,Jace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.19,0:11:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,都有心去死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.35,0:11:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,祝您愉快 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day,ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 祝您好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}And good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要一包牛肉干 还有薄荷糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have some beef jerky and a pack of menthols.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你我也很高兴 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeeze,nice to see you too,Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在叫Steve\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Steve,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你我很惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.73,0:12:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不瞒你说 我也很惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,the feeling is mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我们要低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man,we had to lay low for the angel threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 哇哦 你这掩护身份真成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...Whoa,this is some cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有荣光了 你觉得会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grace's gone.What did you expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how hard it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.13,0:12:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我坠天的时候有多难 我不仅仅是丢了荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I fell to earth,I didn't just lose my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我一无是处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.47,0:12:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我是销售助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a sales associate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 销售助理啊 - 嘿Steve\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sales associate - Hey,Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿签下字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sign here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我负责存货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm responsible for inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,出售 还有客户服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sales,customer service.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我让这里 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep this place...Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.89,0:12:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,保持干净整洁的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean and presentable and.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,经理忙的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my manager's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.33,0:12:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我还会准备吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even prepare the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 你从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa,so you went from.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.21,0:12:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂里的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting heavenly battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,变成专门加热肉卷的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To nuking taquitos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还有墨西哥玉米片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nachos,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我这几周来 都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been politely asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.51,0:12:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,很友好的请你送几本好书下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To reading material for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:12:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你就给我拿来这个啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you bring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不看 - 你到底懂不懂古埃兰语\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pass - Can you read Elamite or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我最喜欢的古语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's by no means,my favourite of the ancient tongues.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是懂 - 能帮我们破解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But yes - Will you help us read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.51,0:13:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why on earth would I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.13,0:13:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那晚我也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was there,that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你的人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what humanity did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你喜不喜欢 你心中的某一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not,there's still a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of you that's not a douche.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.62,0:13:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 麋鹿 我是个彻头彻尾的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry moose,to the last drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.86,0:13:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley 你活下来的唯一原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley,the only reason you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为我哥觉得你有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my brother thought you'd be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,目前为止 你什么用都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far you've done Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们要考虑备用计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to Plan B I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,什么备用计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,把你送给Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give you up to Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为用那个小贱人就能威胁到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can threaten me with that hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她被愤怒冲晕了头 没有一点儿用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's all fury,no finesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:13:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我还真不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,上次我们见她的时候 她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our last encounter with Abaddon,she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她挺吓人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's pretty terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,比你吓人多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scarier than you've been in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,纸给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not you,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你可是个天使啊 别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're above this.Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不 Dean 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,Dean.I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我没能做好一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed to be an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我想做好事 但每次结局都不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I ever attempted came out wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.81,0:14:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我还有做对的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I have a shot to getting things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你可能看不到 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you can't see it,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作中有尊严存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a real dignity in what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,人类的尊严\N{\fnArial\fs30}A human dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想打扰你们 但是有个顾客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hate to interrupt you guys,but a customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在男厕里出了点儿小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had an accident in the men's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哦对了 今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,and tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你7点过来 没问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}7 at my place work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.96,0:15:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是真正原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个姑娘 - 不是的 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The girl - No,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nora\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,她人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a very nice woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常确定 她不想取我性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty she's not a reaper intend on killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她还约我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's asked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.15,0:15:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,人类是会去约会的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going on dates,something humans do,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我一般碰不上单身就不约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dates usually end when I run out of singles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对 对 我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,yeah,yeah,that's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,会 去 约会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That...humans...do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Lee Ermey探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Agent Lee Ermey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,又一起凶杀案 在一所高中里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is another kill,over at the high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我都没有荣光了 去了有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be much use,I don't have my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢 我从来都没有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?I've never had powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:15:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.57,0:16:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你是猎人学徒 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're a hunter-in-training,remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说我很差劲 - 我没说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said I sucked - I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.62,0:16:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said there was a.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有进步的空间 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,a room for improvement.Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.98,0:16:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我还有5分钟下班\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.My shift's over in 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.94,0:16:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约会是在晚些时候 - 这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My date's not until later - Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我去开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go to get the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.05,0:16:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我先把卫生间清理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to clean the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本来在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}One second,we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.85,0:16:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她突然\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the next,she just.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没有动静了 之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stops and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:17:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,整个食堂里的人都吓呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in the cafeteria,freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大家冲到窗户前 指着窗外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rushing and pointing out window at.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 真的是她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God,could that really be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人看到其他陌生人出现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody saw anybody else at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是男的还是女的 没有不寻常的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man or a woman...anything unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.65,0:17:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友 有抑郁的迹象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend,was she...depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思 - 有自杀倾向吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Depressed? - Any thoughts of suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她可能有有些不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean she's kind of bummed that dick bag Travis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她的混蛋前男友当着全校的面甩了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broke up with her in front of whole school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有些不高兴 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kind of bummed - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,比她考试拿C要不高兴得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like more bummed than she got a C on a quiz and.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有她父母离婚时那么沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less bummed than when her parents split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就是 不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda...bummed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.77,0:18:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?What's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 在哪儿见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?Where.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.89,0:18:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}In heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思 是天使干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,you're saying an angel did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不是普通天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no ordinary angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 这次太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.88,0:18:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,非常严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在天堂里\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the battlefields...of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.82,0:18:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有一级特殊的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a special class of angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,叫Rit Zien\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rit Zien.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,天使语中的救济天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enochian for hands of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就像医护人员 上战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}They function like medics.They tended to the wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,去救受伤的天使 特别是很难好的伤 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They healed those who couldn't be healed,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对于那种救不回来的重大创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the mortally wounded those who were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Rit Zien的任务就是毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Past saving,the rit zien's job was to put them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就是炸成碎片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the granulated bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他们的特殊能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was their...special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们这种毁灭的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had this way of smiting that was so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,很快 很彻底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick and so total that it rendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:19:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至都不会有疼痛感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death virtually painless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.31,0:19:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他们下手的对象不是受伤的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these aren't wounded angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是普通人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they are vaporizing.They are people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.77,0:19:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Rit Zien尾随痛苦而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rit Zien home in on pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,痛苦就像是他们的灯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a beacon to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 当此天使坠天以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,when this angel fell to earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定听到了受害人的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He heard the victim's cries,their anguish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就像在天堂能听到天使的痛苦一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same to hear the angel in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他在人间继续曾经在天堂的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's continuing his heavenly work down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,每次一个受难的凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One suffering human at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.57,0:19:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 但是这个女孩儿没有受苦受难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but this last victim was not suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.45,0:19:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就只是一个冲动的孩子而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a normal moody kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.26,0:19:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他刚才来过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.41,0:19:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,人类情绪的变幻莫测\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ebb and float human emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 我也来凡间好几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...I've been on earth for a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我才刚刚能理解 对他来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've only begun to grasp,to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,痛苦不会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain is pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那么所有人都有可能是下一个受害者了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So everybody is fair game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.75,0:19:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真好 我们得阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,well,we got to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你要阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不一样了 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's different now,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我去追这位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,I'll track down this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,变态医生 再干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevorkian wanna be,and I'll put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.82,0:20:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你别惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.43,0:20:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,去约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on that date,all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,过正常人的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}G live a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你载我一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.82,0:20:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但是不是无偿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want something in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.06,0:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要什么 - 打一通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that - A telephone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 麋鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是Dahmer(连环杀人案凶手)也有打电话的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Dahmer got one telephone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你真想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,让他给Abaddon打电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna let Crowley communicate with Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一个地狱之王加上企图篡权的地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A king and a power-mad knight of hell isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你还嫌不够乱 想组个混种恶魔军团是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna throw a demonic team up into mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.17,0:21:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.91,0:21:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 我也不相信Crowley 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...I don't trust Crowley either,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.74,0:21:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 我觉得他不会和Abaddon合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't honestly see him working with Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.66,0:21:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他恨死她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hates her too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.25,0:21:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.57,0:21:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不一定要相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.66,0:21:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley已经被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,Crowley's bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以随时挂电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can end the call whenever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.88,0:21:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就算他想给Abaddon泄露什么消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if he wanted to give Abaddon information.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.55,0:21:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他也没什么好透露的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has nothing to give her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他连基地的位置都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He don't even know where the bunker is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他能破解那些文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he can decrypt the translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.55,0:21:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他要是撒谎怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这倒是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这些怎么解\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.86,0:21:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 材料 - 什么材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ingredients - More specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.77,0:21:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一个 咒语的材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ingredients...for a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,拿非利人的心 丘比特的弓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart of a Nephilim,Cupid's bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.03,0:22:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,天使的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace of an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.95,0:22:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.47,0:22:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,等我打了电话 就告诉你们剩下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get the rest,when I get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 你们谁愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,who's gonna be a dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,把电话给我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And open up a vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能就这么让你进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.97,0:22:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.01,0:22:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你就穿这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.32,0:22:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,去约会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有这一身\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all I have,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.94,0:22:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,马甲脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose the vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么要 - 脱马甲 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you - Lose the vest,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.65,0:23:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这样稍微好一点儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a little better.All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.17,0:23:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,解扣子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now your button.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,解开几个口子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you unbutton it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.23,0:23:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.84,0:23:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等等等 够了够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's...that's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.15,0:23:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tony Manero(《周末夜狂热》的男主角)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony Manero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.87,0:23:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,good,all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 一定要你给她开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me,always open the door for her,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要问好多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask a lot of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.51,0:23:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,女人们就喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.52,0:23:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她说她想去荷兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if she says she's happy to go Dutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,她一定在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.03,0:23:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.23,0:23:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and get her,tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.14,0:24:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.71,0:24:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么倒车呢 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing,jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.05,0:24:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.39,0:24:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Steve 你能来真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve,I'm so glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.04,0:24:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.41,0:24:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我会赶不上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.97,0:25:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赶不上什么 - 我的约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Late for what - My date.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.40,0:25:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去打保龄球 太难以置信了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bowling,would you believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.26,0:25:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不过就算是去打保龄球\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,damn if I'm not dressing fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.11,0:25:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要盛装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even for bowling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.58,0:25:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,自从Tanya出生以来 我都一直没机会穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't had an excuse to doll up since Tanya was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.93,0:25:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来看看我的小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is,my little angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经喂过她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she's already been fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.20,0:25:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我估计她会一直睡下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll probably sleep the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.98,0:25:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我只出去几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll only be gone for a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.16,0:25:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我平时用的保姆过不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just couldn't get my usual sitter and.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.34,0:25:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,万一她醒过来哭泣的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need somebody here in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.66,0:25:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要有人在家看着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wakes up and starts crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.47,0:25:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我保证她不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which she won't,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.43,0:25:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanya从来不哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby Tanya never cries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.40,0:25:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,祝我好运吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish me luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.83,0:25:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谢谢你 你真是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thank you,you really are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.36,0:25:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,看孩子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babysitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.82,0:25:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-bup-bup.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.60,0:26:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.59,0:26:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不要你的 要他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yours,his.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.40,0:26:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这有什么区别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What difference does it make.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.00,0:26:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我用过你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.72,0:26:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我都已经被困在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuck in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.59,0:26:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在饮食上要求点儿花样不算过分吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't fault me for wanting a little variety.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.79,0:26:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.15,0:26:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong,short round.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.14,0:26:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你害怕针头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid of needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.81,0:26:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 只是我个人的原则是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I just have policy not giving blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.32,0:26:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不给杀了我母亲的人提供血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}To anyone who's murdered my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.19,0:26:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我有的是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing but time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.79,0:26:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.70,0:26:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你们翻译顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.31,0:27:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.02,0:27:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.60,0:27:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我接 是Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connect me to…Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.30,0:27:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,信号不大好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.92,0:27:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley 你们的王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley,your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.31,0:27:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你现在不给我接Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't connect me to Abaddon right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.89,0:27:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不得不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be forced to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.86,0:27:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.47,0:27:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们让我等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been placed on hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.66,0:27:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.41,0:27:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.12,0:27:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.34,0:28:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你唱个摇篮曲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a lullaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.51,0:28:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 嘘 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,shh,shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.44,0:28:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我身上都发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what's happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.47,0:28:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,连我自己都不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.75,0:28:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,忽然之间我坐在云端\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly I'm on top of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.11,0:28:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,忽然之间又变成了普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly I'm somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.70,0:28:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不管你信不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.28,0:28:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在感觉很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm walking on air.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.94,0:28:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没想过自己会如此自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought I would be so free.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.73,0:28:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,支起翅膀飞向远方 一路歌唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flying away on a wing and a prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.31,0:28:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那人会是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,who could it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.59,0:28:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你信不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.19,0:28:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.39,0:28:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你信不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.15,0:28:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.67,0:29:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.57,0:29:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a wrinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.73,0:29:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,第一个犯罪现场 那对夫妇的死亡现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our first crime scene,married couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.15,0:29:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚从实验室那边获得了化验结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full analysis of the spray just came from the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.16,0:29:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现场只有那妻子的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out it only contains the wife's DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.27,0:29:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是说那丈夫还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The husband's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.89,0:29:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没人告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.61,0:29:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也没人解释过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.33,0:29:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你就这么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just shoved out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.14,0:29:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,连哭带喊的诞生在这世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kicking and screaming into this human life without.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.30,0:29:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,也不知道为什么你会感觉到你所感觉的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea why any of you feels the way you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.58,0:29:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也不知道为什么会有那么多困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or why this confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.43,0:29:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉就像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just feels like it's a hair's breadth from.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.95,0:29:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧 或者痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terror,or pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.29,0:29:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就当你以为你明白一切了的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,just when you think you do understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.17,0:29:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,结果发现你还是什么都不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll turned out you were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.82,0:30:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么也不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't understand anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.86,0:30:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,事实就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just how it is when you're new at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.38,0:30:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,其实就在不久之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,it wasn't that long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.73,0:30:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我只要轻触一下你的额头\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need to do to ease your pain is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.75,0:30:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就会解除你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.80,0:30:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你的温度有点高啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.28,0:30:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这正常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.39,0:30:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh,shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.52,0:30:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他差点儿就精神失常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's already a bit screwy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.05,0:30:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但他又找到了信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then he found religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.71,0:30:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个绝对的无神论者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a hard line atheist no peach herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.92,0:30:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,当他对那个愚蠢的Boyle牧师表现出极大的兴趣后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he got himself obsessed with this Buddy Boyle wackjob.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.61,0:30:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,本来就很糟的婚姻变得愈发不可收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}An already bad marriage got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.23,0:30:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不断告诫她要相信上帝的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kept telling her to let God in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.17,0:30:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,牧师Boyle 这就解释的通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy Boyle,that explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.24,0:30:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,解释了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explains what.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.43,0:30:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.13,0:30:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that his truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.18,0:30:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.48,0:30:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.83,0:30:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nora 她发烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora,she's really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.01,0:31:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,请给我回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just call,call back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.21,0:31:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't hear back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.55,0:31:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我就带她去医院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking her to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.81,0:31:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 Tanya 我们出去走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,Tanya,we're taking a little walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.24,0:31:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.91,0:31:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可悲的小傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squalid little dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.67,0:31:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,怪不得她要哭啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder she cries.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.16,0:31:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,她发烧了而已 Ephraim 她会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fever,Ephraim.It'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.36,0:31:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得我的名字呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.53,0:31:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们见面的时候 我还什么都不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just nobody when we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.90,0:31:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你那时候已经是个传奇人物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you,you were a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.96,0:31:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前就来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.21,0:31:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我是头一次来人类的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.72,0:31:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,它很\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.56,0:32:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,很令人紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.86,0:32:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始对人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there is a lot you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.70,0:32:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定有很多不明白的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand about humanity at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.81,0:32:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会停下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.83,0:32:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我把这个星球上所有的痛苦清除干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I wash the planet clean of all suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.67,0:32:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.26,0:32:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.02,0:32:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我是为她而来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I came for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.90,0:32:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.06,0:32:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.60,0:32:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,接通恶魔电话需要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will it take to transfer demonic phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.03,0:32:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别吵 鹿鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can it,moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.50,0:32:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley 你也打了电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley,you got your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.81,0:32:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.34,0:32:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我说是时候了的时候 才是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time when I bloody well say it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.66,0:32:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 Abadon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello Abadon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.03,0:32:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.26,0:32:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in the hell are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.16,0:32:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多的痛苦和绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much pain and despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.47,0:33:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.50,0:33:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,乞求着解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begging out for relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.02,0:33:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.94,0:33:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你避开天使了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are warded.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.33,0:33:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,和我找到其他病人的方法一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same way I found all my patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.16,0:33:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是跟着你痛苦的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just followed the sound of your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.99,0:33:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道那有多大声\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how loud it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.94,0:33:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我在几里之外就能听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear you from miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.03,0:33:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.07,0:33:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里做天堂的工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are doing heaven's work down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.53,0:33:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.05,0:33:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.90,0:33:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,地球有时是个很难生存的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth can be a hard place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.40,0:33:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人类 他们可以变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}These humans,they can get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.05,0:33:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只是在尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are just doing the best they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.10,0:33:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你认为你在做的事吗 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think you are doing,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.44,0:33:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.00,0:33:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.25,0:33:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果这就是著名的Castiel的尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if this is the best of the famed Castiel can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.30,0:33:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你的处境比我想象的还要狼狈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a more urgent case than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.68,0:33:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经崇拜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to admire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.08,0:33:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你失败的的次数远超过你成功的次数\N{\fnArial\fs30}You failed more often than you succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.20,0:33:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但至少你曾经是做大事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at least you played big.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.88,0:34:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.34,0:34:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,把头埋在沙子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burying your head in the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.63,0:34:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在你的族人最需要你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right when your kind need you most.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.06,0:34:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,数量怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.35,0:34:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说灵魂数量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.38,0:34:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,比你预想的要多一倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've managed a double on your projections.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.14,0:34:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我是怎么能 成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,how did I ever pull off such a feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.16,0:34:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你在提前收取灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are taking souls before their time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.55,0:34:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,取消我的契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voiding my contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.66,0:34:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.80,0:34:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在把它们销毁掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking it all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.02,0:34:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一点一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brick by brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.82,0:34:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.07,0:34:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley 官僚主义之王 的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The days of Crowley,the king of bureaucrat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.55,0:34:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.24,0:34:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.00,0:34:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把疼痛带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the pain away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.96,0:34:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我想活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.03,0:34:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是以什么身份呢 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as what,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.80,0:34:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,作为天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}As an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.97,0:34:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.96,0:35:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,肮脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ganky.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.38,0:35:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,恶心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putrescent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.11,0:35:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skanger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.47,0:35:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的效率在你看来可能不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may look like bean-counting to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.28,0:35:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,可能缺少技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}May lack a certain adolescent flair.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.22,0:35:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的方法奏效\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my way works.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.05,0:35:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你能控制地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can control hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.68,0:35:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就以这么混乱的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}With chaos alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.09,0:35:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不用支持 来自\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the the support of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.77,0:35:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,依然忠于我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are still loyal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.47,0:35:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,已经有一周没人看见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's seen you in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.07,0:35:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我最后一次见你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the last I saw you,Howdy and Doody had you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.37,0:35:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你正被两兄弟好好地绑着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tied up nice and tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.61,0:35:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好像 把你变成哈巴狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems to reason,they've turned you into a kennel dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.31,0:35:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样啊 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it feel Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.08,0:35:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,当了Winchester的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be the Winchesters' bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.12,0:35:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,听着你在这儿虚张声势 还真是有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been fun indulging in your bluffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.98,0:35:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你我都知道 你已经没有权威了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we both know you have no real authority left.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.45,0:35:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}No leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.43,0:35:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你没什么能提供给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have nothing to offer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.89,0:35:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.12,0:35:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.60,0:35:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,迟早会遭到反噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will backfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.96,0:35:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.11,0:36:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.18,0:36:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.83,0:36:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,把埃兰文给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the translations.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.06,0:36:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我履行我的合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep my agreements.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.15,0:36:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,取得原料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obtain the ingrdients.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.46,0:36:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,心脏 弓 荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart,bow,grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.69,0:36:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah blah blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.86,0:36:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,混合 直到有烟从灰烬中升起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mix until the smoke shall rise from the ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.30,0:36:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,将天使驱逐出天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casting the angels from heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.69,0:36:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah blah blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.24,0:36:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不可逆转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,It's irreversible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.87,0:37:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.88,0:37:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这个咒语无法被逆转\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spell can't be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.75,0:37:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,新世界已经降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new world order.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.88,0:37:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能受着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're stuck with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.55,0:37:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你想活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.42,0:37:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我能看到 你看不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't see what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.78,0:37:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,选择一个人类的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}By choosing a human life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.20,0:37:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've already given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.76,0:37:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你选择了死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.95,0:37:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.20,0:37:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.59,0:37:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不 Dean 这次没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,Dean,not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.16,0:37:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Metetron让这个咒语经得起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metetron built the spell to withstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.92,0:37:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,任何让其逆转的尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any attempt to reverse it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.60,0:37:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,无法再把天使放回天堂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no putting the angels back in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.10,0:37:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.88,0:38:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你会告诉Cass吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.46,0:38:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉我反应过度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I overreacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.38,0:38:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友给了我一个小窍门\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend gave me a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.41,0:38:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,少量的醋氨酚能快速退烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A low dose of acetaminophen brought the fever right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.05,0:38:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.62,0:38:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我的约会本来就是个灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Date was a bust anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.78,0:38:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Steve\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.32,0:38:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你反应过度\N{\fnArial\fs30}The part of you that overreacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.09,0:38:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That care so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.71,0:38:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,正是如此 才让你如此特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what makes you special.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.52,0:38:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.88,0:39:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,准备去哪儿啊 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where to,Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.60,0:40:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 Cass 在基地里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen Cass,back at the bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.98,0:40:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我 很抱歉我把你赶走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...Sorry I told to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.20,0:40:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你过得很不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's been hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.70,0:40:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你只剩自己一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.72,0:40:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但你适应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you are adapting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.93,0:40:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.58,0:40:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.24,0:40:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是就像Ephraim说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is something Ephraim said.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.38,0:40:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,天使们 他们需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels,they need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.34,0:40:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我真的能坐视不理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I really sit this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.73,0:40:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我不该寻找让他们回家的途径吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't I be searching for a way to get them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.24,0:40:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我和Sam会处理天使的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam will take care of the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.41,0:40:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在是人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are human now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.75,0:40:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这不再是你的问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your problem anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.84,0:41:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,流星雨已经过去几周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been weeks since the massive meteor storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.04,0:41:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是爱达荷州的天文学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet Idaho falls astronomers still.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.51,0:41:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有给出答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.75,0:41:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,华盛顿当局和航天局\N{\fnArial\fs30}NASA and Washington are both continuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.39,0:41:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,将继续研究这一现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}To study the phenomenon
